    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "The supervisor programmer's model consists of supplementary registers used in the supervisor mode. The M68000 MPUs contain identical supervisor mode register resources, which are shown in Figure 2-2, including the status register (high-order byte) and the supervisor stack pointer (SSP/A7').",
