      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "The supervisor programmer's model supplement of the MC68010 is shown in Figure 2-3. In addition to the supervisor stack pointer and status register, it includes the vector base register (VRB) and the alternate function code registers (AFC).The VBR is used to determine the location of the exception vector table in memory to support multiple vector",
